     3	## LB-001: Downward Grid Discretization
     4	
     5	For \(\mathcal G_K=\{0,1/K,\ldots,(K-1)/K\}\), round any \(a\in[0,1]\) down to \(b(a)\in\mathcal G_K\). Since \(b\le a\), every future price exceeding \(a\) also exceeds \(b\), and
     6	\[
     7	r_t^H(a)\le r_t^H(b)+1/K.
     8	\]
     9	Therefore \(R_T^H\le R_{T,K}^H+T/K\). This is accepted.
