    19	## LB-003: Weighted Truncation
    20	
    21	For fixed \(H\),
    22	\[
    23	0\le r_t(a)-r_t^H(a)=a\,1\{H<\tau_t(a)\le T-t\}
    24	\le a\,1\{H<\tau_t(a)<\infty\}.
    25	\]
    26	Taking conditional expectations and using \(\gamma(H)\) gives
    27	\[
    28	R_T\le R_T^H+T\gamma(H).
    29	\]
    30	Status: accepted.
