    83	## LB-008: Horizon/Process-Aware Pseudo-Regret Collapse
    84	
    85	For an exogenous policy-independent law \(P\), define
    86	\[
    87	V_T^P(a)=\mathbb E_P\sum_{t=1}^T r_t(a),
