    64	Notes: This obstruction is specific to the problem's \(\sup_a\mathbb E-\mathbb E\) regret. It need not hold for \(E[\sup_a]\) pathwise regret; a hidden common state can make the best pathwise fixed quote substantially better than the best fixed quote in expectation.
