   480	# Iteration 8 Consolidation
   481	
   482	## Accepted Progress
   483	
   484	- Promoted the same-path multi-threshold anytime lift. For a deterministic known block
   485	\[
   486	0^N,c_1,\ldots,c_m,\qquad 0<c_1<\cdots<c_m\le1,
   487	\]
   488	after an old prefix of length \(M\), any process-aware but horizon-oblivious policy satisfies
   489	\[
   490	\max_j R_{M+N+j}\ge N\kappa(C)-M.
   491	\]
   492	The intermediate threshold-round learner rewards cancel against the comparator's extra threshold-round opportunities; no finite \(O(m)\) loss is needed.
   493	- Promoted the equal-revenue same-path diagonal corollary. With blocks \(0^{N_i},C_i\), equal-revenue menus \(m_i\to\infty\), and \(M_i+m_i=o(N_i)\), one deterministic known path forces every horizon-oblivious policy to have
   494	\[
   495	\limsup_T R_T/T\ge1/e.
   496	\]
   497	- Added the equal-revenue primal zero-block certificate: uniform mass on quotes just below the equal-revenue thresholds gives the matching local deficit \(((m-1)/m)^m\).
