   566	the unique root \(F_C(\delta_*)=1\) equals \(\kappa(C)\) as a local infimum value. The primal uses left-limit weights on \(c_i^-\), and the dual is a truncated equal-revenue law on the active suffix \(c_i>\delta_*\).
