    21	Upper bound: use \(h^-\) on old high coordinates and all post-low coordinates. On the conflict coordinates before the low price, put total \(\ell^-\)-mass \(P=S/h\), and \(h^-\)-mass on the rest. Feasibility follows from \(S\le h(N+\mathbf 1\{M\ge1\})\). Low/intermediate horizons have deficit \(S-\ell P\), and the final high horizon has deficit \((h-\ell)P\), both equal to \(S(1-\ell/h)\).
    22	
