    24	\[
    25	\alpha=1-\ell/h,\qquad \beta=\ell/h
    26	\]
    27	on the low horizon \(T_0=M+N+1\) and final high horizon \(n\). Old high and post-low coordinates cancel. Each conflict coordinate contributes at most
    28	\[
    29	\sup_a\{\alpha a1\{a\le \ell\}+\beta a1\{a\le h\}\}=\ell,
    30	\]
    31	leaving exactly \(\alpha S\).
