\[
R_T\le \sum_{t<T}\delta(C_t)+o(T)
\]
for deterministic known exogenous paths, with explicit path-oracle, horizon-oblivious, `sup` comparator, exogeneity, and strict-crossing \(\eta\)-implementation assumptions.

